flowchart TD
  Data[Original data x₀] --> Forward[Add noise by time step t]
  Noise[Random noise ε] --> Forward
  Forward --> Xt[Noisy state xₜ]
  Xt --> Train[Model predicts ε]
  Train --> Loss[Learn from error against actual noise]
  Start[Generation starts: initial noise x_T] --> Predict[Predict noise at current step]
  Predict --> Step[Scheduler computes next state]
  Step --> Result[Generated result after repetition]
